TITLE Calcite kinetics, pH 2, 200C, Cu and Ba, pe 4
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    -water 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
        -tol 1e-12

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals Alkalinity
END
